	<http://sbols.org/v3#description> "RBS (Elowitz 1999) -- defines RBS efficiency" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#description> "RBS based on Elowitz repressilator." ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#author> "Vinay S Mahajan, Voichita D. Marinescu, Brian Chow, Alexander      D Wissner-Gross and Peter Carr IAP, 2003." ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#created> "2003-01-31T07:00:00.000Z" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#note> "Varies from -6 to +1 region from original sequence to accomodate BioBricks      suffix.   <p>No secondary structures are formed in the given RBS region. Users should check      for secondary structures induced in the RBS by upstream and downstream elements      in the +50 to -50 region, as such structures will greatly affect the strength      of the RBS." , "Contact info for this part: <a href=\"mailto:(bchow@media.mit.edu)\">Brian Chow</a>" ;
