	<http://sbols.org/v3#description> "Syk-dnaEc-VP16AD" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#description> "Syk kinase with SH2 domains coupled at the C terminus to dnaEc-VP16(activation domain). This construct was inserted into pcDNA3.1(+)Zeo using XbaI and EcoRV." ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#author> "Omar Khan" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#source> "Syk from OpenBiosystems (Clone ID: 30533300)\ndnaEc from dnaE gene of Synechocystis sp.(split inteins)(2624-2749bp)\nVP16AD from HSV1 helper virus (Sapolsky Lab, Stanford)(2750-2887bp)" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#created> "2007-10-25T06:00:00.000Z" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#note> "A flexible GS Linker (GGGGS)x5 (or more) is required between the dnaEc and Syk. This was quite difficult to clone in with the FseI site used in the part." ;
